DonateToPool_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given paused
│  └── it should revert
└── given not paused
   ├── given no stakes in the pool
   │  └── it should revert
   └── given two stakers in the pool
      ├── given insufficient allowance
      │  └── it should revert
      ├── when amount zero
      │  └── it should not move tokens or change the dividends
      └── when amount not zero
         └── it should spread the donation over all stakes
            ├── it should pull the tokens into the pool
            ├── it should not credit a stake to the donor
            ├── it should raise every staker's reward pro rata
            └── it should emit {Payout} event
